---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 17, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Beautyflow Beauty Salon"
  description="Beautyflow Beauty Salon's terms and conditions. Learn about the conditions for using our services."
  lang="en"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fdf8f6] via-white to-[#f8f4f9]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase text-center font-bold">
        Terms and Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 md:p-12 space-y-8">

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">1. Service Provider</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Company name:</strong> ABEAUTYFLOW Kft.<br />
            <strong>Registered office:</strong> 1135 Budapest, Reitter Ferenc utca 90., Hungary<br />
            <strong>Tax number:</strong> 32724316-1-41<br />
            <strong>Company registration:</strong> 01-09-439280<br />
            <strong>Email:</strong> hello@beautyflow.pro<br />
            <strong>Phone:</strong> +36 1 300 9414
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">2. Services</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Beautyflow Beauty Salon provides the following cosmetic and beauty services:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>Diode laser hair removal</li>
            <li>Korean facial treatments</li>
            <li>HydraBeauty facial treatment</li>
            <li>Carbon Peeling</li>
            <li>Permanent makeup (eyebrows, lips, eyeliner)</li>
            <li>Laser permanent makeup removal</li>
            <li>Tattoo removal</li>
            <li>Pigmentation removal</li>
            <li>Skin rejuvenation treatments</li>
            <li>Other cosmetic treatments</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">3. Booking</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Appointments can be booked via the Notino.hu platform, by phone, or in person.
            A booking becomes final upon confirmation.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            By booking an appointment, the client declares that they have read, understood,
            and accepted these Terms and Conditions and the
            <a href="/en/house-rules" class="text-[#c53f75] underline">House Rules</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">4. Cancellation Policy</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>Appointments may be modified or cancelled free of charge up to <strong>48 hours</strong> before the scheduled time.</li>
            <li>Cancellations within 48 hours incur a fee of <strong>25%</strong> of the treatment price.</li>
            <li>Cancellations within 24 hours incur a fee of <strong>50%</strong> of the treatment price.</li>
            <li>Rescheduling within 48 hours qualifies as a cancellation and is subject to the above conditions.</li>
            <li>Cancellations within 48 hours are accepted exclusively by phone (+36 30 834 6204).</li>
            <li>Replies to automated SMS or email messages sent by the Notino system do not qualify as official cancellations or modifications.</li>
            <li>If the client has an outstanding cancellation fee, a new appointment can only be booked after it has been settled.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">5. Deposit</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>For new clients, a deposit of <strong>50%</strong> of the treatment price is payable, which is deducted from the final amount.</li>
            <li>For treatments of 2 hours or longer, a deposit of <strong>50%</strong> of the treatment price is payable by all clients to finalize the appointment.</li>
            <li>The appointment becomes final once the deposit has been received.</li>
            <li>The deposit must be paid within 72 hours.</li>
            <li>For the diode laser Diamond package, a 50% deposit is payable.</li>
            <li>For clients holding a treatment pass, the pass qualifies as a means of payment.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">6. Payment Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Accepted payment methods:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>Cash</li>
            <li>Debit/Credit card (Visa, Mastercard)</li>
            <li>Revolut transfer</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">
            The service fee is payable on-site after the treatment is completed.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">7. Late Arrival</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Clients are required to arrive at the booked time, or at most a few minutes
            earlier. If, due to the client's late arrival, the treatment can no longer be
            fully performed within the booked time slot, the service provider is entitled to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>shorten the duration of the treatment,</li>
            <li>perform the treatment partially,</li>
            <li>or consider the appointment cancelled.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">
            In such cases, the cancellation policy applies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">8. No Show</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            If the client fails to appear at the booked appointment without prior notice,
            it qualifies as a no-show. In this case:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>the deposit is not refundable,</li>
            <li>the service provider is entitled to invoice 100% of the treatment price,</li>
            <li>the service provider is entitled to refuse future bookings.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">9. Deposit Refund</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            The deposit is credited towards the treatment price. A deposit refund is only
            possible if the cancellation is made at least 48 hours before the treatment.
            In the case of cancellation within 48 hours or a no-show, the deposit is forfeited.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">10. Health Requirements</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Before the treatment, the client is required to inform the service provider of
            any health condition that may affect the safety of the treatment. In particular:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>pregnancy or breastfeeding</li>
            <li>infectious disease</li>
            <li>active herpes</li>
            <li>fever</li>
            <li>skin conditions</li>
            <li>blood clotting disorders</li>
            <li>blood-thinning medication</li>
            <li>cancer</li>
            <li>epilepsy</li>
            <li>diabetes</li>
            <li>use of photosensitizing medication</li>
            <li>recent sunbathing or tanning bed use</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">
            The service provider is entitled to refuse the treatment if performing it would
            pose a health risk.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">11. Results and Guarantee</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Treatment results may vary from person to person and may be influenced by,
            among other factors:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>hormonal condition,</li>
            <li>age,</li>
            <li>genetic factors,</li>
            <li>skin type,</li>
            <li>lifestyle,</li>
            <li>medication use,</li>
            <li>at-home care.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">
            Therefore, the service provider does not guarantee any specific result or full
            recovery.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">12. Aftercare</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            The client is required to follow the verbal and written aftercare instructions
            provided after the treatment. The service provider assumes no liability for
            damages resulting from failure to follow the aftercare instructions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">13. Photo Documentation</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            The service provider may take photographs before and after treatments for
            documentation purposes. Use for marketing purposes only takes place with the
            client's prior, express consent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">14. Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The service provider assumes no liability for damages resulting from:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>health information withheld by the client,</li>
            <li>false declarations,</li>
            <li>violation of the aftercare instructions,</li>
            <li>or disregard of the treatment recommendations.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">15. Gift Cards and Passes</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li>Passes and gift cards cannot be redeemed for cash.</li>
            <li>They are valid for 12 months from the date of purchase, unless otherwise agreed.</li>
            <li>Lost gift cards cannot be replaced.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">16. Complaints</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Complaints may be submitted at the following contact:<br />
            <strong>Email:</strong> hello@beautyflow.pro<br /><br />
            The service provider will investigate the complaint within 30 days at the latest
            and respond in writing.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-gray-900 mb-4 uppercase font-bold">17. Final Provisions</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Matters not regulated in these Terms and Conditions are governed by applicable
            Hungarian law, in particular the provisions of the Hungarian Civil Code. The
            service provider reserves the right to modify these Terms and Conditions.
            Modifications take effect on the day of publication.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-8">
        <a
          href="/en/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-[#c53f75] text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide rounded-full hover:bg-[#a33460] transition-colors"
        >
          Back to Homepage
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
